[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-main 2.Bf4"]
[Name "...c5 on move two"]

2... c5 { Hits d4 at once, before the knight has come out. }
3. e3 { Supports d4. Note that the bishop came out before this move, so nothing is shut in. }
3... Nc6
4. c3 { The wedge again. Against ...c5, c3 comes before the knights. }
4... Nf6
5. Nf3 *
